@host = http://localhost:5200

### 1. Kiem tra REST API trang thai dich vu
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Bat tay SignalR Negotiate lay connectionId va transport options
POST {{host}}/hubs/ping/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 3. Goi truc tiep hub bang HTTP thuong (Mong doi: 400 Bad Request - Connection ID required)
GET {{host}}/hubs/ping

